t just for those of us who can  afford to pay the premium and because at  the heart of it all we are what we eat  and what I am is a lifelong foodie and  maybe you are too because you love food  just like me but as you leave this talk  I want to implore you to become a farm E  as well so that you can change the  system more than the system has changed  you thank you
 

